# ── Agent profile: baseten ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Selected by AGENT_PROFILE=baseten. Every key here belongs to Baseten and to no other provider;
# a switch is a change of AGENT_PROFILE in the env file, never an edit here.
#
# THIS IS THE PUBLIC-AGENT ROUTE ONLY — the public repo page's question and pull-request review
# runs. It is a separate slot from LLM_PROFILE because the two genuinely differ: this surface is a
# long tool-calling loop against the code graph and wants one strong model with reasoning on, while
# the deployment route wants the cheap-first tier chain. Riding LLM_PROFILE would force one choice
# on both.
#
# The four move TOGETHER. A base URL, the credential that endpoint issued, a model id that endpoint
# answers to, and the operating mode that model needs. Mixing one provider's key with another's base
# is a 401 that reads like an expired key.
AGENT_LLM_BASE_URL=https://inference.baseten.co/v1
AGENT_LLM_API_KEY=replace-me-in-stack-settings
AGENT_MODEL=deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813

# What this model costs, in USD per million tokens, as printed on every review's report. REQUIRED:
# config.ts rejects an unset or non-numeric value at startup rather than reporting a run as free.
# IT BELONGS TO THE MODEL NAMED ABOVE, so AGENT_MODEL and these two change together — a model swap
# that leaves a stale price here reports the new model's tokens at the old model's rate and nothing
# says so. Read from Baseten's own catalog: GET https://inference.baseten.co/v1/models reports `pricing` per model.
AGENT_LLM_INPUT_PRICE=1.32
AGENT_LLM_OUTPUT_PRICE=3.96

# Operating mode. REASONING IS CHARGED AGAINST THE COMPLETION CEILING on this provider, whatever the
# docs say, so these two are one setting in two fields.
#
# Measured on a review of tldraw#10571 (2026-09-21): at high/4096 the model reasoned out a verdict
# for every hunk and was then cut off mid-sentence with no tool calls at all — a turn that cost a
# full completion and delivered nothing, ending the review having cleared 0 of 13 hunks. At
# medium/8096 the same review cleared 13 of 13. Raise the ceiling before lowering the effort if you
# need more thinking: an empty turn is the failure mode, not a shallow one.
AGENT_REASONING_EFFORT=medium
AGENT_MAX_COMPLETION_TOKENS=24000
